# title: Locally capped cliquet
# category: Cliquets
# underlyings: 1
# source: Wilmott, Cliquet Options and Volatility Models, Wilmott Magazine, 2002
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: Adds up four quarterly returns, each floored at 0% and capped at 3%: a guaranteed-positive, capped exposure to steady growth.
#
# Notional 1000. Each quarter's return is measured from the previous
# quarter's close, then clipped to [0%, 3%].

2027-01-04
    ref = spot()
    total = 0

2027-04-05  2027-07-06  2027-10-04
    total = total + min(max(spot() / ref - 1, 0), 0.03)
    ref = spot()

2028-01-04
    total = total + min(max(spot() / ref - 1, 0), 0.03)
    pays 1000 * total
